HollowIsle_House_Text_OldWomanGift::
    .string "You came up past the BURNED TOWER?\p"
    .string "My mother told me three POKéMON\n"
    .string "died in that fire and rose again.\p"
    .string "Here, take this charm. It's done\n"
    .string "more good for you than for me.$"

HollowIsle_House_Text_OldWomanReceived::
    .string "{PLAYER} received a SPELL TAG!$"

HollowIsle_House_Text_OldWomanAfter::
    .string "A POKéMON holding a SPELL TAG\n"
    .string "hits harder with GHOST moves.\p"
    .string "Morty's GHOSTS were never shy\n"
    .string "about that sort of thing.$"

HollowIsle_House_Text_OldWomanNoRoom::
    .string "Oh, your BAG is full.\p"
    .string "Make some room and come back.\n"
    .string "It will keep until then.$"

